| 1689 | T1 | 🔲 Open | Soon | P3 | `billing` | **Company AI token pack TOP-UP purchase flow + member-facing pool indicator** (opened 2026-05-28, follow-on to #1679). The shared-pool plumbing landed in #1679: `company_token_balance` exists and is DEBITED on overflow, and the employer can see/cap members via WorkforceSettings. **Still missing**: (1) a way to BUY company pack tokens — the per-user TOKEN_PACK Stripe flow ([payment.ts](hired.video/api/src/routes/payment.ts) + `addTokenBalance`) credits `user_token_balance`; a company analog needs a `company_token_balance` credit path + a "buy tokens for your team" CTA so the pool can be topped up once the seat-derived monthly allowance runs out. (2) `tokenLedger.charge` returns a null budget DTO for employees (the per-user pill would be misleading), so an employee's AI pill no longer updates per-response — add a member-facing read off `getCompanyTokenBudget` (or surface `monthlyRemaining`/sub-cap) so members see the pool/their-cap remaining. **Fix**: extend the pack-purchase webhook to target a company when the buyer is an employer + add `creditCompanyTokenBalance`; add a small pool pill fed by a `GET /workforce/my-pool` (member-scoped) endpoint. **Unblocks**: employers can fund AI beyond the seat allowance; members see how much pool/cap they have left. |
