| 2100 | T1 | 🔲 Open | Mid | P3 | `quality` | **Earnings rollup conflates mixed-currency accruals into one total** (opened 2026-06-14 with #1185) | `PayoutLedgerService.getEarningsRollup` sums `amount_cents` across all accrual rows regardless of each row's `currency`, then labels the total with the payout-profile's `payoutCurrency` — the same simplification `getBalance` already makes. A creator paid in both USD and EUR would see the two added as if one currency. Low impact today (payouts are USD-dominant) but wrong once non-USD rails see volume. Fix: either group the rollup by `(source, currency)` and render per-currency subtotals, or convert via a stored FX rate at accrual time. Pairs with the same fix on `getBalance`. |
