| 1906 | T4 | 🔲 Open | Later | P3 | `feature` | **Host-side reservation comment thread inline on `/bookings`** (opened 2026-06-04 from #1648 close). The route is wired ([bookings.ts](hired.video/api/src/routes/bookings.ts) `POST /me/reservations/:id/comments` + `GET .../comments`) and the booker sees comments inline on the magic-link reservation page, but the host dashboard ([BookingsHost.tsx](hired.video/frontend/pages/bookings/BookingsHost.tsx)) renders reservation cards without the inline thread. Fix: drop the existing `listReservationComments` + `addReservationComment` client fns into an expandable row per reservation; alternatively, link each card to a `/bookings/:id` detail route that shows the wide reservation + thread + Stripe payment status + reschedule history. Unblocks: hosts can respond to booker notes from the dashboard instead of clicking through a magic link they don't have. |
