| 1955 | T3 | 🔲 Open | Now | P1 | `arch` | **Studio as the universal authoring surface — migrate every remaining create/edit form into the Studio (PRD)** (opened 2026-06-07, user-directed) | The "Studio creates/edits/previews ALL content" pattern (proven for resume + job) extended to every authoring surface. Full plan + per-entity task breakdown: [docs/prd/studio-unified-authoring-migration.md](hired.video/docs/prd/studio-unified-authoring-migration.md). Model: the entity's **meta panel** (structured fields = "the form" the user fills on create — e.g. a Course's title/cover/summary/theme/category/tags/price) + a **body** runtime (paged `document` canvas for resume/job/article/blog, OR a NEW non-paged `structured` builder for ordered-list/DAG entities, OR none for meta-only entities). **Foundation (Phase 0, gates the structured track):** T0.1 structured-builder Studio runtime (#1918), T0.2 shared schema-driven meta-panel (reuse [document-field-schema.ts](hired.video/frontend/lib/studio/document/document-field-schema.ts) + add chips/category/price/theme field types), T0.3 `studioAuthoringHref` deep-link convention, T0.4 StudioLanding catalog entries (#1917), T0.5 per-entity retirement playbook. **Tracks:** Phase 1 document (Articles/Blog T1.1, Job-create funnel T1.2 — ride the shipped canvas, parallel); Phase 2 meta-only (Companies T2.1, Offerings T2.2, Voice clones T2.3); Phase 3 builders (Courses T3.1 flagship, Pitch decks T3.2, Screening templates T3.3, Interview sets T3.4, Job scorecards T3.5 — closes #1954 deferral); Phase 4 Learning paths/cohorts T4.1 + Profile-edit decision T4.2. Each entity DoD = catalog+deep-link, meta schema, body runtime, create-on-first-save save-back, repoint all "+ New"/"Edit" entry points, DELETE the standalone page+orphaned forms, detail page renders via the shared renderer. Rolls up under #1915 + #1918. Unblocks: one authoring experience across all content; deletes thousands of lines of bespoke form code. **Phase 0 partially landed 2026-06-07 (tsc + 128 studio tests green):** T0.2 shared field engine extracted to [FieldGroupEditor.tsx](hired.video/frontend/components/studio/fields/FieldGroupEditor.tsx) (one input switch — text/textarea/date/day/list/`chips`/number/select/multiselect/image; `chips` tag-pills added) consumed by both [SectionEditor](hired.video/frontend/components/studio/document/SectionEditor.tsx) (de-duped) and the new [MetaPanel](hired.video/frontend/components/studio/shared/MetaPanel.tsx) (schema-driven entity META form — "the form is the meta panel"). T0.1 CORE = the structured runtime's pure model + mutations + tests: [builder-state.ts](hired.video/frontend/lib/studio/builder/builder-state.ts) (`BuilderState` ordered node tree + per-entity node levels `BUILDER_ENTITY_DEFS` for course/screening/interview/pitch-deck/scorecard/learning-path) + [builder-edit.ts](hired.video/frontend/lib/studio/builder/builder-edit.ts) (add/remove/update/move/find — recursive, immutable) + 13 unit tests. T0.3 = [studio-authoring.ts](hired.video/frontend/lib/studio/studio-authoring.ts) (`DOCUMENT_AUTHORING` registry + `studioEditHref`/`studioCreateHref` + `STUDIO_EDIT_PARAMS`); StudioLanding's 3 near-identical edit branches collapsed into ONE registry-driven loop. **Remaining Phase 0 (→ #1918):** T0.1 MOUNT + persistence — `BuilderStage`/`BuilderView` components, a `structured` mediaKind (shared/media-kinds.ts + the 3 exhaustive switches + a migration relaxing the media_kind CHECK), a `builder_state` JSONB column + saveDraft/toProjectDto/runtime-state-payload wiring, `CanvasRouter` surface + `useKindHydration`; T0.4 StudioLanding catalog entries; repoint existing "+ New"/"Edit" call sites through `studioEditHref`. |
