| 1338 | T4 | 🔲 Open | Later | P3 | `perf` | **Routes over-fetching full rows when the UI only needs `{id, title, slug, ...}`** (opened 2026-05-25). Confirmed at `routes/calendar.ts:45` (returns attendees JSONB + reminderMinutes array even on list endpoints); spot-checked `routes/users.ts` (password_hash is stripped at the serializer but other heavy columns leak). Over-fetching inflates Worker→client bytes + Neon→Worker bytes + JSON parse cost. How to apply: switch list endpoints to projection-form selects (`db.select({ id: t.id, title: t.title, ... }).from(t)`) instead of `db.select().from(t)`. Detail endpoints can keep the full row. |
