| 1500 | T3 | ⚠️ Partial | Later | P3 | `feature` | **Certificate signing — Ed25519 + external-provider opt-out paths** (opened 2026-05-26 during #165 close). [CertificateService](hired.video/api/src/services/learning/certificate-service.ts) signs with HMAC-SHA256 + verifies same-origin only. Asymmetric signing (Ed25519 over Web Crypto, published JWKS endpoint) + an Accredible / Credly write-through (`externalProvider` + `externalId` columns already exist on the row) is the v2 plan. **Partial (TK6, 2026-06-16):** asymmetric signing + JWKS shipped — `CertificateService` signs new certs with Ed25519 when a keypair is provisioned (3-part `${b64}.${sig}.ed25519`; HMAC stays the default 2-part format, so every existing cert takes the unchanged HMAC verify path — base64url has no "."). `verify()` discriminates by format; added `publicJwk()` + public `GET /api/verify/.well-known/jwks.json`. 9 tests (HMAC back-compat, Ed25519 sign/verify, tamper, wrong-key, missing-key, JWK shape). **Operational:** dormant until `CERT_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY` (PKCS8 b64) + `CERT_ED25519_PUBLIC_KEY` (raw b64) env secrets are set — without them behavior is byte-identical to today. **Residual (blocked):** the Accredible/Credly write-through (`externalProvider`/`externalId`) needs vendor API credentials; key-rotation/`kid` history is a future enhancement. |
