| 1162 | T2 | 🔲 Open | Soon | P2 | `feature` | **Geo — `fetchCardFeed.geo` is only honored by the jobs fetcher; articles/videos/services/templates/people fetchers ignore it** (opened 2026-05-24 alongside #1154) | UnifiedSearch passes a structured geo filter into `fetchCardFeed` via the new `geo` option (gap #1154). Only `fetchJobs` threads it through to its underlying endpoint. The other per-domain fetchers ([fetchArticles, fetchVideos, fetchPeople, fetchTemplates](hired.video/frontend/lib/card-feed.ts)) silently ignore it — so the LocationFilter UI on the unified search page currently narrows jobs only, not articles/videos/etc. To close: each fetcher passes `geo` to its endpoint. The cheapest path is to route ALL fetchers through `/api/search/public?category=X&countryId=&stateId=&cityId=` (which already supports geo for every kind via the structured allowlist) instead of per-domain endpoints — that consolidates the search query path and gets geo for free. Pairs with #1154. |
