| 1314 | T3 | 🔲 Open | Later | P3 | `feature` | **`/blog` is the unified "Blog & Guides" surface (#1315); `/articles` remains the sector+audience-filtered variant** (opened 2026-05-25, partially addressed 2026-05-25). **Done in this pass**: the merger logic that powers `/blog` was extracted to [frontend/lib/unified-posts.ts](hired.video/frontend/lib/unified-posts.ts) (`UnifiedPost` type + `blogPostToUnified` + `articleCardToUnified` + `mergeUnifiedPosts`) — both surfaces can now consume the same shape without re-implementing the normaliser. **Still open**: pick a convergence story between the two filter axes. Options: (a) `/articles?sector=X` redirects to `/blog?category=<sector-slug>` once sectors map cleanly onto category chips, OR (b) `/articles` becomes a thin wrapper around the same `<UnifiedPostsListing>` component BlogIndex uses, with sector+audience filters layered on top. (b) is the lower-risk path because the sector landing CTAs already point at `/articles?sector=…`. To close: write the convergence PRD into [docs/prd/](hired.video/docs/prd/) + ship the chosen variant. |
