| 1797 | T1 | 🔲 Open | Mid | P2 | `feature` | **CAD 3D Phase 2 residual — TransformControls gizmo + primitive palette + per-primitive inspector** (split from #930 closure 2026-05-30). (a) drei `<TransformControls>` translate/rotate/scale gizmo on selection (today selection paints a wireframe overlay). (b) Cad3DPalette left-rail with drag-to-canvas primitive picker (box/cylinder/sphere/extrude + add-boolean-op group). (c) Per-primitive inspector right-rail panels (dims for box/cylinder/sphere, profile editor for extrusion, op picker for boolean nodes) — same shape as the 3D World `InspectorPanel`. (d) STEP/IGES/glTF native encoders (today's 2D `cad-stl-encoder.ts` already extrudes shapes to STL — the 3D runtime's native encoders are a follow-on). Unblocks: a directly-authorable 3D modelling surface for hobbyists / mechanical hardware / 3D-print pipelines. |
