| 186 | T3 | 🔲 Open | Soon | P1 | `feature` | **Candidate share consent + GDPR audit trail** | Legal gate for the agency redacted-share feature. `candidate_share_authorizations` table records which candidate authorized which agency to share which resume to which jobs, with expiry. Every tokenized share checks authorization at render time and fails closed. GDPR subject-access-request endpoint exports every share event for a candidate. Required for EU/UK/California operation. |
| 244 | T3 | 🔲 Open | Soon | P1 | `feature` | **Compliance workspace (GDPR + EEOC + Outreach unsub + SMS consent)** | One Settings → Compliance tab consolidating: GDPR scope (All / EU only / etc), lawful basis (legitimate interest vs consent) for archived candidates, retention period, privacy-policy link, EEOC scope, SMS-consent ledger, bulk-≥10 unsubscribe-injection toggle. Wires existing `privacyPreferences` + adds tenant-scoped policy rows. Closes the surface gap left by #186. |
| 1755 | T1 | 🔲 Open | Soon | P1 | `feature` | **E-sign provider production integration — wire DocuSign / Dropbox Sign / Anvil HTTP API into the workforce ESignConnector stub** (split from #310 closure 2026-05-30) | [esign-docusign.ts](hired.video/api/src/services/workforce/connectors/esign-docusign.ts) currently has the interface shape but the HTTP calls are stubbed. To close: pick the vendor (vote: Dropbox Sign for the cheapest per-envelope pricing at our scale + easier W-9/W-8 templates), implement `createEnvelope` against `POST /v3/signature_request/send_with_template` + `getEnvelopeStatus` against `GET /v3/signature_request/{id}`, add the webhook receiver that updates `payout_profiles.tax_form_document_ref` + flips `tax_form_submitted_at` when signing completes. Pairs with #310 (caller surface already wired). |
