| 1182 | T3 | 🔲 Open | Later | P3 | `feature` | **`/privacy/opt-out` anonymous flow is localStorage-only; CCPA "verifiable consumer request" form for unidentified visitors is mailto-only** (opened 2026-05-24 alongside #1149 — renumbered from #1167) | [PrivacyOptOut.tsx](hired.video/frontend/pages/PrivacyOptOut.tsx) handles authenticated cleanly (server-side `do_not_share` flip) and rejects optional cookies in localStorage for anonymous visitors. The "I want to opt out without signing in" path currently just emails privacy@hired.video — fine under CPRA but creates manual ticket load. To close: add an `/api/privacy/anonymous-opt-out` endpoint that accepts `{ email, requestType: 'do-not-sell' | 'access' | 'deletion' }`, sends a verification link to the email (proving consumer ownership), and on click toggles the flag + adds the email to a suppression list keyed independently of user_id. Pairs with #1149 + #1181. |
